          "_name": "features8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features8\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitleCards\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bg\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#ff8a8a\">\n\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\" selected>5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n            <option value=\"11\">11</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">12</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-cards=\"bootstrap\">\n            <div class=\"title col-12\">\n                <h5 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>The inconvenient truth of&nbsp;</b><b>many OnlyFans Creators:</b><div><b>\n</b></div><div><b>\n</b></div></h5>\n                <h6 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Does this sound familiar?</h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Don't know how to start?</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">You are just getting started, but you have absolutely no clue, where you should start? Understandable, thousands of Creators are standing in front of the 100 different Social Media Channels, OnlyFans Strategies and decisions.\n<br>\n<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Where are my results?</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">You are doing OnlyFans for several weeks or even months, but your fan count or earnings don't go up? You are probably focusing on the wrong strategies.\n<br>\n<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Missing Visibility</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">There are 2+ Million OnlyFans Creators out there and everyone wants a part of the cake - if you are not unique or if you do the same and look like every other Creator you will stay hidden.<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Lack of motivation &amp; consistency</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">A lack of motivation and consistency is deadly for your OnlyFans success. An OnlyFans Management Agency helps you to focus on the tasks which have the best Return of Time and keeps you motivated and accountable.\n<br>\n<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>4\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>No time to handle everything by my own</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Handling Marketing, the OnlyFans, talking to Fans, keeping your Fans happy, creating Content, coming up with content ideas, doing tax, ... can be very stressful, time-consuming and your OnlyFans suffers massively in the long run, especially if you want to have a balanced life besides the work. \n<br>\n<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>5\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>7\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>8\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>9\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>10\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$49</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount>11\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"top-line\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Special Issue</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">$39</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                            All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special\n                            actions required. For your commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
